==== Wifi on/off toggle by QSS button ====
Read [[docs:guide-user:hardware:hardware.button|this howto]] to use buttons on TP-Link 

//Found in WR741ND wiki page and coppied. It works on WR841ND too.//

(Thanks to obsy) [[https://forum.openwrt.org/viewtopic.php?id=26871|Wifi toggle by QSS button]]
Simply create a new file called 01onoff in /etc/hotplug.d/button/
<code>
